# {{.Name}}

A PagerOS app scaffolded by `pagerctl init python`.

## Run

```sh
python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
python app.py --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
```

Then point a simulator or device at `http://127.0.0.1:8000/`.

## Publish

```sh
pagerctl publish
```

`pagerctl publish` reads `manifest.yaml`, walks the DNS TXT challenge for the
URL's host, and registers the app with the Marketplace.
